融合交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Month-intra integrated trading combines monthly energy transactions with contract transactions in a continuous, rolling auction format, allowing for incremental energy trades, contract transfers, and contract amendments within a single framework, improving efficiency and simplifying organization.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力直接交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Direct power trading refers to electricity purchase and sale transactions between power generation entities and power consumption entities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"集中竞价交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Centralized bidding trading involves participants submitting time-specific volume and price information via a trading platform, with final bids determined by the last valid submission before closing. It uses either unified marginal pricing or quote matching methods for clearing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"双边协商交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Bilateral negotiation trading is a method where two parties agree on terms and one party sends an invitation through the platform, which the other accepts; it requires verification and confirmation by relevant parties and allows updates before the deadline.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"滚动撮合交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Rolling matching trading is a form of centralized trading where participants can continuously submit offers and bids, and trades are matched immediately upon mutual agreement, enabling real-time execution.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"挂牌交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Listing trading is a type of centralized transaction where participants place offers or bids publicly on the platform, allowing others to accept them at any time during the trading window.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"数年交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Multi-year trading refers to transactions involving electricity volumes over periods exceeding one year, forming the basis for long-term planning and commitments.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"年度交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Annual trading involves electricity volumes for the next calendar year, typically organized regularly and used for long-term supply-demand alignment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"月度交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Monthly trading covers electricity volumes for the following month or remaining months within the year, often scheduled periodically and based on forecasted demand.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"月内交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Intra-month trading refers to transactions for remaining days within a given month, usually conducted daily from the second-to-last day of the previous month to the second-to-last day of the current month, with delivery based on D+2 to the end of the month.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"统一边际电价法\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Unified marginal pricing method is a clearing mechanism in centralized bidding where the market-clearing price is determined at the intersection point of the buyer's bid curve (descending) and seller's offer curve (ascending), with transactions occurring below the marginal price for sellers and above for buyers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"报价撮合法\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Quote matching method is a clearing process where bids and offers are sorted and matched sequentially based on price difference, with trades executed as long as there is a positive gap between buyer’s bid and seller’s offer.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"The power dispatching agency provides data and information necessary for power market registration, trading, settlement, and services to the power trading agency, ensuring accuracy and timeliness.\" <|>\"data sharing, operational coordination\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"电网企业代理购电交易\"<|>\"The power trading agency facilitates and manages the grid enterprise proxy purchasing electricity service by organizing related transactions and providing settlement support.\" <|>\"market facilitation, service provision\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"绿色电力交易\"<|>\"The power trading agency organizes green power trading activities, ensures compliance with information disclosure rules, and operates the platform for these transactions.\" <|>\"market management, green energy integration\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"合同转让交易\"<|>\"The power trading agency enables contract transfer trading by providing the platform and procedures for transferring unfulfilled contracts, including handling associated rights and responsibilities.\" <|>\"contract management, transaction facilitation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"合同变更交易\"<|>\"The power trading agency supports contract amendment trading by offering mechanisms for bilateral negotiation and formalizing changes to contract terms such as volume, price, and power curve.\" <|>\"contract modification, market flexibility\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"月内融合交易\"<|>\"The power trading agency organizes and operates month-intra integrated trading, combining multiple transaction types into a single continuous process to enhance efficiency and simplify operations.\" <|>\"transaction integration, operational innovation\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"集中竞价交易\"<|>\"The power trading agency conducts centralized bidding trading by managing the platform, processing bids, and applying clearing algorithms such as unified marginal pricing or quote matching.\" <|>\"market mechanism execution, clearing process\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"双边协商交易\"<|>\"The power trading agency enables bilateral negotiation trading by hosting the platform where parties can send and receive proposals, and confirm outcomes after validation.\" <|>\"negotiation support, transaction confirmation\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"合理安排电网运行方式\"<|>\"The power dispatching agency is responsible for reasonably scheduling grid operation modes and conducting safety checks to ensure stable and secure power system operation.\" <|>\"grid management, system security\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"信息披露\"<|>\"The power trading agency executes information disclosure requirements by operating the disclosure platform 