port concerns about registration or deregistration via verified channels, requiring proof and truthful reporting.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"合同处理完毕声明\"<|>\"document\"<|>\"A declaration submitted by a deregistering entity confirming all existing contracts have been settled or resolved before removal from the market.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"数字安全证书\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A digital security certificate is a mandatory authentication mechanism used by market participants to securely access the power trading platform, ensuring identity verification and transaction integrity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"履约保函、保证金或其他结算担保品\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Financial guarantees such as performance bonds, deposits, or alternative collateral mechanisms required to secure contractual obligations and ensure financial reliability in market transactions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可再生能源消纳责任\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The obligation imposed on certain market participants, especially power sales companies and resource aggregators, to consume or facilitate the consumption of renewable energy in accordance with national policy mandates.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"输配电服务\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The service provided by grid enterprises enabling the transportation of electricity from producers to consumers, guaranteed to be fair and non-discriminatory across all market participants.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"信息披露\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The requirement for all market participants to disclose relevant information publicly and timely, ensuring transparency, accountability, and informed decision-making within the electricity market framework.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"经营主体\"<|>\"The power trading institution manages the registration and deregistration processes for operating entities, reviewing applications and verifying compliance with rules.\"<|>\"regulatory oversight, procedural management\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"The power trading institution reports automatic deregistrations and significant 